menu "Dancefloor"

    config DANCEFLOOR_BLINK_GPIO
        int "GPIO to pulse for scope measurement"
        default 4
        help
            Set per board -- the two units do not need the same pin, and board
            silkscreens rarely agree. This is an output only; do NOT wire the two
            boards' pins together. Avoid strapping pins (0, 2, 5, 12, 15), flash
            pins (6-11), and 25/26/27 if this board also drives I2S.

    config DANCEFLOOR_MONITOR_GPIO
        int "GPIO the master watches for the satellite's pulse"
        default 21
        help
            Master only. Wire the SATELLITE's blink output to this INPUT pin on
            the master, plus a common ground. The master then times the incoming
            edge against its own blink deadline and prints the sync error, so no
            oscilloscope is needed. Must differ from the blink GPIO.

    config DANCEFLOOR_ROLE_MASTER
        bool "This unit is the master (runs SoftAP, owns the clock)"
        default y
        help
            Master runs the SoftAP, answers time probes and announces blink times.
            Satellites join the AP and follow. Flash one board with this on and
            the other with it off.

endmenu
